{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.62] We'll be here, lettin' go\n[00:06.40] (Chopsquad)\n[00:07.70] Someone needs to let me know\n[00:09.58] I'm havin' problems lettin' go\n[00:21.40] Overload (Hahaha)\n[Chorus]\n[00:27.02] I'm havin' problems lettin' go\n[00:31.42] I need solutions, someone let me know\n[00:38.32] I can't help it when I lose control\n[00:44.58] This a emotional overdose\n[Verse 1]\n[00:51.74] I tried to talk but you ain't givin' feedback\n[00:54.70] My depression really hungry and you feed that\n[00:57.72] You say you love me, but I don't know if you mean that\n[01:00.98] And I'm scared (Hahaha)\n[01:04.86] You've been helpin' me avoid a relapse\n[01:07.72] All your love and affection, I need that\n[01:10.74] You prolly tired of me, yeah, I understand (Hahaha)\n[01:17.52] I'ma make this song bleed, need a Kleenex\n[01:20.62] Girl, you make me happy like a kid at recess\n[01:23.66] But when you mad, you make me feel like a reject, no jerk\n[01:30.58] You separate my angels from my demons\n[01:33.18] Pinch myself 'cause it feels like I'm dreamin'\n[01:36.20] But when you not here for me, the nightmares begin\n[Chorus]\n[01:43.56] I'm havin' problems lettin' go\n[01:49.28] I need solutions, someone let me know (Hahaha)\n[01:56.16] I can't help it when I lose control\n[02:02.42] This a emotional overdose\n[Verse 2]\n[02:08.50] Huh, I cannot pretend that I don't care\n[02:12.14] Hittin' below the belt, that shit hurt, and it's not fair\n[02:15.34] Traumatized thoughts, girl, that shit gon' leave a mark, yeah\n[02:19.28] Imagine takin' a bullet to the heart, yeah\n[02:36.26] Nowadays, I don't know where home is\n[02:49.00] But you're the closest thing to a home I have\n[03:03.02] But right about now I feel homeless\n[03:06.86] Back to the heartbreak flashbacks\n[Chorus]\n[03:11.00] I'm havin' problems lettin' go\n[03:15.66] I need solutions, someone let me know\n[03:20.12] I can't help it when I lose control\n[03:23.90] This a emotional overdose","words":[[0.08